<section class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>What is Deep Learning Indaba × Botswana 2026?</h2>
        <p>Deep Learning Indaba × Botswana is a premier AI conference bringing together researchers, developers, startups, and innovators across Botswana and beyond.</p>
        <p>Our 2026 event centers on the theme <strong>"Our Data. Our Intelligence. Our Future."</strong> reflecting a bold vision for AI in Africa:</p>
        <div class="about-grid">
            <div>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Building solutions</strong> using African data</li>
                    <li><strong>Empowering local talent</strong> and innovation</li>
                    <li><strong>Driving real-world impact</strong> across key sectors</li>
                </ul>
                <p>Through workshops, technical sessions, keynotes, AI Fest exhibitions, and networking opportunities, we create a platform for advancing AI education and real-world application in Botswana.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="event-details-card">
                <h3>Event Details</h3>
                <p><strong>Dates:</strong> July 29–31, 2026</p>
                <p><strong>Venue:</strong> Botswana School of Business Science</p>
                <p><strong>Location:</strong> Gaborone, Botswana</p>
                <p><strong>Expected Attendees:</strong> 300+ participants</p>
                <p><strong>Speakers:</strong> 25+ international and local experts</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

